  "pal_park_encounters": [],
  "form_descriptions": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいないに　すうひゃくリットルの\nどくえきを　ためている。　ＵＢと\nよばれる　せいぶつの　いっしゅ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "체내에 수백 리터의\n독액을 갖고 있다.\nUB라고 불리는 생물의 일종이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "體內儲存著數百公升的毒液，\n是被稱為究極異獸的生物\n中的一種。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Son corps contient des hectolitres de poison.\nIl fait partie de ces créatures que l’on nomme\n« Ultra-Chimères ».",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Eines der Lebewesen, die Ultrabestien genannt\nwerden. In seinem Körper bewahrt es Hunderte\nLiter giftiger Flüssigkeit auf.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una de las temibles criaturas conocidas como\nUltraentes. En su cuerpo almacena cientos\nde litros de veneno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È una delle forme di vita note come\nUltracreature. Il suo corpo contiene\ncentinaia di litri di veleno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It stores hundreds of liters of poisonous liquid\ninside its body. It is one of the organisms known\nas UBs.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体内に　数百リットルの\n毒液を　ためている。\nＵＢと　呼ばれる　生物の　一種。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体内储存着几百升的毒液。\n是被称为究极异兽的生物中的一种。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una de las temibles criaturas conocidas como\nUltraentes. En su cuerpo almacena cientos\nde litros de veneno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウルトラビーストの　いっしゅ。\nどくばりから　ねんどが　たかく\nひかる　どくえきを　はっしゃする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "울트라비스트의 일종.\n독침에서 점도가 높고\n빛나는 독액을 발사한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "究極異獸的一種。\n會從毒針發射出\n黏度很高的發光毒液。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Cette Ultra-Chimère utilise son aiguillon pour\nsécréter un venin toxique, luisant et gluant.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Diese Ultrabestie verschießt aus ihren\nGiftstacheln ein leuchtendes, dickflüssiges Gift.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Uno de los Ultraentes. Su aguijón segrega un\nlíquido tóxico cuya viscosidad le da una\napariencia brillante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Una delle Ultracreature. Il luminoso liquido\ntossico che emette dagli aculei è caratterizzato\nda un’elevata viscosità.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "One kind of Ultra Beast, it fires a glowing,\nvenomous liquid from its needles. This liquid\nis also immensely adhesive.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ウルトラビーストの　一種。\n毒針から　粘度が　高く\n光る　毒液を　発射する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "究极异兽中的一种。\n会从毒针发射出\n黏性很大又发光的毒液。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
